  "instructions": {
    "text_instructions": [
      {
        "id": "11a1b1c1d1e1f1a2b2c2d2e2f2a3b3c3",
        "content": [
          "## WanderBricks Intelligence Platform\n\n",
          "This Genie space answers business questions about WanderBricks, a vacation rental marketplace. ",
          "Data spans bookings, properties, hosts, guests, and destinations across multiple countries.\n\n",
          "### Key Metric Definitions\n\n",
          "**Gross Booking Value (GBV):** Total confirmed booking revenue. Formula: SUM(total_amount) WHERE status = 'confirmed'. Time dimension is booking creation date.\n\n",
          "**Net Revenue:** Platform commission = GBV \u00d7 0.15. Host payout = GBV \u00d7 0.85.\n\n",
          "**Average Daily Rate (ADR):** Revenue per booked night = SUM(total_amount) / SUM(nights).\n\n",
          "**Occupancy Rate:** Percentage of available property-nights booked. Range 0 to 1 (multiply by 100 for percentage).\n\n",
          "**Average Length of Stay (ALOS):** Average nights per booking.\n\n",
          "**Guest Satisfaction Score (GSS):** Recency-weighted average rating (1.0-5.0 scale). Weights: 30d=3.0, 90d=2.0, 365d=1.0, >365d=0.5. Target: platform-wide \u2265 4.2.\n\n",
          "**Superhost Status:** Requires ALL: avg_rating_90d \u2265 4.5, completed_bookings_90d \u2265 10, cancellation_rate < 2%, response_rate \u2265 90%.\n\n",
          "**Negative Review Rate:** Reviews with rating < 3.0 / total reviews. Alert threshold: > 20%.\n\n",
          "### Table Guide\n\n",
          "- **mv_revenue_metrics**: Pre-aggregated daily revenue by property and destination (use for revenue questions)\n",
          "- **mv_occupancy_metrics**: Monthly occupancy, ALOS, lead time by property/destination (use for utilization questions)\n",
          "- **mv_guest_satisfaction**: Per-property GSS with recency weighting (use for satisfaction/review questions)\n",
          "- **mv_host_performance**: Per-host Superhost qualification metrics (use for host performance questions)\n",
          "- **gold_revenue_daily**: Detailed daily revenue with host payout split\n",
          "- **gold_occupancy_monthly**: Monthly property utilization with guest counts\n",
          "- **gold_guest_satisfaction**: Per-property satisfaction with review timeline\n",
          "- **gold_host_performance**: Per-host metrics for Superhost evaluation\n",
          "- **gold_property_summary**: Property master with lifetime aggregates, location, and quality metrics\n\n",
          "### Tips\n\n",
          "- For revenue trending, use mv_revenue_metrics grouped by booking_date\n",
          "- For destination comparisons, group by destination_name\n",
          "- occupancy_rate is already a ratio (0\u20131); multiply by 100 for percent display\n",
          "- Use gold_property_summary to join property details (type, location, price) to any metric\n",
          "- qualifies_superhost is a boolean indicating current Superhost eligibility\n"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "example_question_sqls": [
      {
        "id": "22a2b2c2d2e2f2a3b3c3d3e3f3a4b4c4",
        "question": [
          "What is the total GBV and Net Revenue by destination?"
        ],
        "sql": [
          "SELECT\n",
          "  destination_name,\n",
          "  SUM(gbv) AS total_gbv,\n",
          "  SUM(net_revenue) AS total_net_revenue,\n",
          "  SUM(confirmed_booking_count) AS total_bookings\n",
          "FROM hls_fde_dev.dev_matthew_giglia_wanderbricks_ai.mv_revenue_metrics\n",
          "GROUP BY destination_name\n",
          "ORDER BY total_gbv DESC"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "33a3b3c3d3e3f3a4b4c4d4e4f4a5b5c5",
        "question": [
          "Which destinations have the highest occupancy rate?"
        ],
        "sql": [
          "SELECT\n",
          "  destination_name,\n",
          "  AVG(occupancy_rate) * 100 AS avg_occupancy_pct,\n",
          "  AVG(alos) AS avg_length_of_stay,\n",
          "  SUM(booking_count) AS total_bookings\n",
          "FROM hls_fde_dev.dev_matthew_giglia_wanderbricks_ai.mv_occupancy_metrics\n",
          "GROUP BY destination_name\n",
          "ORDER BY avg_occupancy_pct DESC"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "44a4b4c4d4e4f4a5b5c5d5e5f5a6b6c6",
        "question": [
          "How many hosts qualify for Superhost status?"
        ],
        "sql": [
          "SELECT\n",
          "  qualifies_superhost,\n",
          "  COUNT(*) AS host_count,\n",
          "  AVG(avg_rating_90d) AS avg_rating,\n",
          "  AVG(cancellation_rate) * 100 AS avg_cancellation_pct\n",
          "FROM hls_fde_dev.dev_matthew_giglia_wanderbricks_ai.mv_host_performance\n",
          "GROUP BY qualifies_superhost"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "55a5b5c5d5e5f5a6b6c6d6e6f6a7b7c7",
        "question": [
          "What are the top 10 properties by Guest Satisfaction Score?"
        ],
        "sql": [
          "SELECT\n",
          "  gs.property_id,\n",
          "  ps.title,\n",
          "  gs.destination_name,\n",
          "  gs.gss,\n",
          "  gs.review_count,\n",
          "  gs.negative_review_rate\n",
          "FROM hls_fde_dev.dev_matthew_giglia_wanderbricks_ai.mv_guest_satisfaction gs\n",
          "JOIN hls_fde_dev.dev_matthew_giglia_wanderbricks_ai.gold_property_summary ps\n",
          "  ON gs.property_id = ps.property_id\n",
          "WHERE gs.review_count >= 5\n",
          "ORDER BY gs.gss DESC\n",
          "LIMIT 10"
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}